      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T16:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed in PS2: `%tab-set!` deletes the entry at a count ≤ 0. Deleting 1000 / 2000 / 4000 elements one at a time takes 0.07 / 0.10 / 0.26 s (12.1 s for 1000 on PS1). A single `set-delete!` on 8000 elements takes 3 ms.",
