      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T21:24:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`valid-n`\u0027s answer is ignored (1232, 1237), and nothing stops a count reaching 0 or below, so bags end up holding zero or negative counts.\n\n- `(bag-product 0 (bag c \u0027a \u0027a))` has size 0, yet `bag-empty?` is #f and `bag-contains? \u0027a` is #t.\n- `(bag-increment! (bag c) \u0027a 0)` leaves `((a . 0))`.\n- `bag-product -1` gives a negative size, and 1/2 a fractional one.\n- `alist-\u003ebag` (1294) accepts zero counts too.\n\nRaise when `valid-n` fails, and delete an entry instead of storing a count ≤ 0.",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
