      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T16:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed in PS2:\n\n- `bag-product` and `bag-product!` raise for 0, -1 and 1/2.\n- `(bag-increment! (bag c) \u0027a 0)` leaves an empty bag. -2 and 1.0 raise.\n- `bag-decrement!` past zero removes the element.\n- `alist-\u003ebag` skips `(a . 0)` and raises for -1 and 1.0.",
      "parentUuid": "17d3327c_728f82c6",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
