      },
      "lineNbr": 1323,
      "author": {
        "id": 1040172
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T16:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed in PS2: nothing is registered. The `(mylib table)` probe prints `value` with (srfi 113), (srfi 146) or (srfi 146 hash) imported after it. `default-hash` of `(1 2 3)` is the same before and after `eval` loads (srfi 113). Registering by hand still works: a set, a mapping and a hashmap inside list keys of a default-comparator table are all found.",
      "parentUuid": "89094493_6f87ad86",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
