      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T16:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done in PS2: `(mapping-catenate c (mapping c 5 \u0027a) 1 \u0027b (mapping c 0 \u0027z))` now raises \"the keys are not in increasing order\", and `m1` is left intact.",
      "parentUuid": "eb9bebfa_89d97aa3",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
