      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T16:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed in PS2. The circular repro returns at once with `mapping-comparator` registered, and the hash reads at most four keys per mapping, so its work is bounded. With `m \u003d (mapping (make-comparator real? \u003d \u003c #f) 1 \u0027a 2 \u0027b)`, `(comparator-hash mapping-comparator m)` now gives the size, 2. The hashmap hash ends too but is still cubic. See 113.sld:1308.",
      "parentUuid": "1823a31c_1b4c674f",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
