      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed in PS2: `(hashmap-ref (hashmap (make-comparator string? string\u003d? #f #f) \"a\" 1 \"b\" 2) \"b\")` gives 2, and the eq?, eqv?, equal? and string-ci\u003d? cases work too. `hashmap-comparator` hashes them with the table\u0027s hash function.",
